  <h1>Using Smart Search Engine (SSE) — TotalRecalls</h1>

  <p>
    Smart Search Engine (SSE) is an add-on for <strong>TotalRecalls Pro</strong>. It indexes
    your Library on your PC, so you can search conversations from all eight providers —
    ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, Gemini, Grok, DeepSeek, Mistral, and Qwen Chat — by
    asking in plain English.
  </p>
  <p>
    Smart Search Engine (SSE) costs <strong>$29 one-time at launch</strong> (regular $58) and requires a
    Downloader Pro license. It runs on Windows 10 and 11. See the
    <a href="/smart-search/">Smart Search Engine (SSE) page</a> for pricing and bundles.
  </p>

  <h2>Before you install</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>You need an active <strong>Downloader Pro</strong> license — Smart Search Engine (SSE) works on the Library that Downloader Pro builds.</li>
    <li><strong>Windows 10 or 11.</strong></li>
    <li>About <strong>8 GB of RAM</strong> and about <strong>2 GB of free disk space</strong>.</li>
    <li>No graphics card is needed.</li>
    <li>Setup needs a one-time internet connection to download the search model. After that, Smart Search Engine (SSE) works without an internet connection.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Running a search</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Open Smart Search Engine (SSE) from the app.</li>
    <li>Type your question in plain English — you don’t need to remember the exact words you used. For example: <em>“how did I handle retrying a failed background job?”</em></li>
    <li>Smart Search Engine (SSE) looks through every conversation from all eight providers and returns the best matching passage, with the key phrases highlighted.</li>
    <li>Each result shows the provider, the conversation title, the file location, and a match score. Click a result to open the original Markdown or JSON file.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>Keeping it current</h2>
  <p>
    Smart Search Engine (SSE) re-indexes your Library on a schedule, so conversations you download today
    become searchable by the next morning. Nothing you save is uploaded — the index
    stays on your PC.
  </p>

  <h2>Privacy</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Smart Search Engine (SSE) runs on your PC.</li>
    <li>Nothing you write or save is uploaded.</li>
    <li>The only internet use is the one-time download of the search model during setup.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Buying Smart Search Engine (SSE)</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Smart Search Engine (SSE) add-on: <strong>$29 launch price</strong> (regular $58), one-time purchase. Requires Downloader Pro.</li>
