    <li>Already own the Downloader? Add Smart Search Engine (SSE) for <strong>$29</strong> at launch.</li>
    <li>Prices may change at any time without advance notice.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Ready to add it? <a href="/smart-search/">Go to the Smart Search Engine (SSE) page</a> or
    <a href="/buy/">buy now</a>.
  </p>
